WEBVTT

00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:33.809
Our challenge is to borrow
from the wisdom of the ages,

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.601
and from our most advanced science,

00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:39.184
to forge this third way.

00:05:39.208 --> 00:05:42.559
One that allows us
to improve and scale our harvests,

00:05:42.583 --> 00:05:44.726
while restoring rather than degrading

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.643
the underlying web of life.

00:05:47.667 --> 00:05:50.018
I belong to neither camp.

00:05:50.042 --> 00:05:52.893
I'm a failed vegan
and a lapsed vegetarian,

00:05:52.917 --> 00:05:54.934
and a terrible backyard farmer.

00:05:54.958 --> 00:05:56.226
If I'm honest,

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.875
I will keep trying at this,
but I may fail.

00:05:59.708 --> 00:06:01.018
But I'm hell-bent on hope,